And to that, I'll add... statues of tiny creatures never give
spellbooks.  Other statues have a (x-1)/(x+10) chance of containing a
spellbook, where x is typically int(DL/2), DL being the dungeon level
on which the statue was created.  Thus, at DL 1-3, you have 0% chance.
 At DL 4-5, x=2 giving a 1/12 chance.  DL 6-7, x=3, 2/13 chance... and
so on.

